r":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/9b/9b786205d67a11147b4d15e84bd39c4531a8ed00951cc18d6ce3d3100516292f.wav","referenceText":"事情看着好像很简单，也许能找到更好的办法。再看看那个小小的细节，合适的时候再揭开。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_fchd030","displayName":"灵巧机变系·顽皮·恶作剧型","locale":"克隆·女性儿童","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/40/40b9c0c077cbefee6ee4314a3cb8dde81e93c92b7d7f2b0bdc53fefcad43e8f2.wav","referenceText":"我刚才发现一个细节，真正的答案还没有出现。先不要告诉其他人，我们可以换个方向试试。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_fchd031","displayName":"内收脆弱系·胆小·怯生型","locale":"克隆·女性儿童","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/61/61da0b2b4fd60d7e035369cf8e68012d93273027acedb52f499dca235ac909d6.wav","referenceText":"我已经把东西收好了，现在还需要慢慢习惯。有些话还要再想一想，需要的时候我会开口。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_fchd032","displayName":"内收脆弱系·胆小·依赖型","locale":"克隆·女性儿童","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/34/34237ac8d39a18552f5794992e07254af8df2e345f64bf70b2d2fdfa32a5b406.wav","referenceText":"我已经把东西收好了，心里还有一点不安。你不用一直看着我，我一直都在认真听着。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_fchd033","displayName":"内收脆弱系·胆小·惊弓型","locale":"克隆·女性儿童","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/58/58153115a07c88ea5e5772372ec6bc82be91e0439a66dbb7d6bf8434baee9eb0.wav","referenceText":"外面的动静有些陌生，我想先在这里等一会儿。有些话还要再想一想，我会努力说明白。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_fchd034","displayName":"内收脆弱系·哭包·委屈型","locale":"克隆·女性儿童","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/df/df3d091be292e86a2c604823dbc8f1e3cc39831aa8704c04cb075fef6a41cc3e.wav","referenceText":"外面的动静有些陌生，我会努力把话说清楚。有些话现在还说不完整，我其实没有真的放弃。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_fchd035","displayName":"内收脆弱系·哭包·撒娇型","locale":"克隆·女性儿童","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/59/593971196293d9ca08bfd26a02ccee66176e9a6c2f3c183158a5f4522dff6411.wav","referenceText":"风从窗边轻轻经过，我想先在这里等一会儿。我只是想先安静一会儿，这阵害怕很快就会过去。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_fchd036","displayName":"内收脆弱系·哭包·敏感型","locale":"克隆·女性儿童","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/90/90b982f70e3f03fa5f6710aa84952ef304acac00ceb7f300f5306944b4653854.wav","referenceText":"外面的动静有些陌生，我会努力把话说清楚。我不太习惯面对这么多人，需要的时候我会开口。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_fchd037","displayName":"内收脆弱系·病弱·安静型","locale":"克隆·女性儿童","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/7b/7b6e5a2935a663756da4be2c383c5b450d6715c06b3f21fc1dddcbd3ea6acfae.wav","referenceText":"风从窗边轻轻经过，心里还有一点不安。我只是想先安静一会儿，需要的时候我会说话。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_fchd038","displayName":"内收脆弱系·病弱·虚弱型","locale":"克隆·女性儿童","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/56/56100d6391bee0c7c1d297161146a61d0f65bc688ea710ea0373f32845eda292.wav","referenceText":"外面的动静有些陌生，心里还有一点不安。不用一直在旁边扶着我，休息以后就能继续。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_fchd039","displayName":"内收脆弱系·病弱·早慧型","locale":"克隆·女性儿童","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/d5/d5f3307a6a7007fe165f810ec3b5b8cf93c19676601dcc6a9c9eecfda53d4c83.wav","referenceText":"风从窗边轻轻经过，心里还有一点不安。这件事情我已经想清楚，我知道下一步怎么做。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_fchd040","displayName":"端正可靠系·早熟·小大人型","locale":"克隆·女性儿童","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/b6/b6348541d9ee43da0821e8346c5b5e60e6c8f2a76c40a5697e2817f68b4d6e7e.wav","referenceText":"眼前的事情已经看清，等大家回来我会说明白。不用替接下来的安排担心，其他答案以后会出现。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_fchd041","displayName":"端正可靠系·早熟·懂事型","locale":"克隆·女性儿童","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/99/99d02d8bcf18f367d54360eab98369fb6381cab47ba6aa6d900a317075b20346.wav","referenceText":"大家交代的话没有忘记，我知道自己应该怎么做。先把眼前最重要的部分做好，我会认真完成。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_fchd042","displayName":"端正可靠系·早熟·冷静型","locale":"克隆·女性儿童","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/eb/ebf9bfb9159d47972317addfbc4ac2ddfe9998b3cc77cd94b4eb9c451927f663.wav","referenceText":"眼前的事情已经看清，重要的部分不会被漏下。大家交代的话我没有忘记，我知道下一步怎么做。"}]}
